   "subject": "Embedding Shiny into a Wordpress blog post using iframe",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">So, I&#39;d like to learn how to embed a Shiny app into a blog post. Since I know nothing about HTML and iframe, I&#39;m following this good post:<div><br></div><div><a href=\"http://stla.github.io/stlapblog/posts/rsm3Dshiny.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stla.github.io/stlapblog/posts/rsm3Dshiny.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792389208899000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2lZVQjfhSSs92LRr-HI9iL\">http://stla.github.io/stlapblog/posts/rsm3Dshiny.html</a><br></div><div><br></div><div>However, I&#39;m having the following problem. When I paste the following into the &quot;HTML&quot; tab of the Wordpress:</div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><div>&lt;iframe style=&quot;border: none; width: 900px; height: 500px;&quot; src=&quot;<a href=\"https://stla.shinyapps.io/3Dsliced/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://stla.shinyapps.io/3Dsliced/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792389208899000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2LhUGv1R4A6_rLE04S9AWs\">https://stla.shinyapps.io/3Dsliced/</a>&quot; width=&quot;900&quot; height=&quot;500&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;<br></div><div><br></div><div>It does seem to work when I switch to the Visual tab:</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Ns2RYOU9TRQ/WYYuxU8Z57I/AAAAAAAABXY/fizxpq65y2sMLyj5QuypSledzz4oILi5gCLcBGAs/s1600/Visual_Tab.png\" style=\"margin-right:1em;margin-left:1em;text-align:center\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Ns2RYOU9TRQ/WYYuxU8Z57I/AAAAAAAABXY/fizxpq65y2sMLyj5QuypSledzz4oILi5gCLcBGAs/s1600/Visual_Tab.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792389208899000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0mDcLSUNVVZL7bj38_IIeE\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Ns2RYOU9TRQ/WYYuxU8Z57I/AAAAAAAABXY/fizxpq65y2sMLyj5QuypSledzz4oILi5gCLcBGAs/s320/Visual_Tab.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"184\"></a><br></div><div><br></div><div>However, when I do post, only the link for the app appears:</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-X67BxeSKkYk/WYYvJ_ca53I/AAAAAAAABXc/OeNCwkGLFFQtjLO-62Jd4MF1rTTMK3v7wCLcBGAs/s1600/testing.png\" style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-X67BxeSKkYk/WYYvJ_ca53I/AAAAAAAABXc/OeNCwkGLFFQtjLO-62Jd4MF1rTTMK3v7wCLcBGAs/s1600/testing.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792389208899000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0xTJfKNFj2eFgNWbv9y1Q0\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-X67BxeSKkYk/WYYvJ_ca53I/AAAAAAAABXc/OeNCwkGLFFQtjLO-62Jd4MF1rTTMK3v7wCLcBGAs/s320/testing.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"112\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>This is probably a very basic question, but what could I be doing wrong?</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
