    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Wordpress is probably stripped the iframe tag when sanitizing your post.<div><br></div><div>Can you right click the vinal page, hit view source, and paste results?  Do a find for iframe and see if it even shows up.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Iframes with shiny and WP are not impossible but can sometimes require things like CSRF tinkering, etc.</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
